OL,3,GNEWSAYoung football fan's 970-mile ride
OL,4,Ain memory of grandad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old football fan has
OL,7,Fcompleted a 970-mile bike ride past
OL,8,Fevery Premier League stadium in memory
OL,9,Fof his grandad.
OL,11,FCharlie, a Southampton FC supporter,
OL,12,Fcycled between all 20 top-flight
OL,13,Fgrounds with his dad Chris in 16 days
OL,14,Fto raise money for Cancer Research UK
OL,15,Fafter his grandad Mike died from cancer
OL,16,Faged 65 last October.
OL,18,FThe pair finished their challenge at
OL,19,FBournemouth's Vitality Stadium on
OL,20,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
