OL,3,GNEWSAYoung football fan's 970-mile ride
OL,4,Ain memory of grandad
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlie, from Bristol, told the BBC: "I
OL,7,Fdid it just because I loved him so much
OL,8,Fand it was very hard watching him
OL,9,Fbattle through cancer so I tried to
OL,10,Fraise money for other people to stay
OL,11,Fwith their grandads longer."
